/*
MDC Rule: Editor and Frontend Style Separation

- Place all frontend styles in `style.scss` and all editor-only styles in `editor.scss` within the block directory.
- Import `editor.scss` only in `edit.js` or `index.js` for editor context.
- Import `style.scss` in the block's entry point for both editor and frontend.
- Scope all styles under the block's root class to avoid conflicts.
- Do not use global selectors or override core/editor styles globally.
